  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/thumbCF.png?raw=true\" alt=\"缩略图\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"标题Logo\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UE85W5ynCg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" width=\"306\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252feldeston\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/eldeston?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;label=@eldeston&amp;color=1DA1F2\" alt=\"Twitter\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg?color=FF0000&amp;logoWidth=16&amp;label=Eldeston&amp;logo=YouTube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/534748?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=#FFFFFF&amp;label=CurseForge下载量&amp;color=#FF9101\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/LMIZZNxZ?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=#FFFFFF&amp;label=Modrinth下载量&amp;color=#00FF00\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"></p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>简介</h2>\n<p>本光影包旨在还原已被取消的<strong>超级炫彩图形包(Super Duper Graphics Pack)</strong>风格及其他热门Minecraft版本的视觉效果。由<a href=\"https://github.com/Eldeston\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston</a>开发，<strong>FlameRender Studios</strong>出品。</p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>BisectHosting赞助</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFLAMERENDERSTUDIOS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Eldeston/Super-Duper-Vanilla/blob/master/shaders/textures/sponsor0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"BisectHosting赞助商\"></a></p>\n<p>本光影由<strong>BisectHosting</strong>赞助。点击上方图片或使用优惠码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFLAMERENDERSTUDIOS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FLAMERENDERSTUDIOS</strong></a>可享首月<strong>25%折扣</strong>！</p>\n<p>选择<strong>BisectHosting</strong>可托管包括<strong>Minecraft、Terraria和Project Zomboid</strong>在内的多款游戏！首单<strong>65%</strong>金额将直接支持Super Duper Vanilla的开发！</p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>宣传视频</h2>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1gaI9rWunhA\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7pNVfX_ywkM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>效果截图</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/bd57c68a400e0722bc7132575ea7cec66ca529ab.png\" alt=\"截图1\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/1d38424b62d4461fae738019cbd1342145e9b4ac.png\" alt=\"截图2\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/8edcb53225f8eeade023759c54df0916d9e3ff2a.png\" alt=\"截图3\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/79de640c0254dd1f8ddf44052a79b57105a53f2c.png\" alt=\"截图4\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/33a5e8c49e4a386c17a42ef48d96f240fa8e7d20.png\" alt=\"截图5\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/f97e5cb26647bd487fae153b9942f87f373f7695.png\" alt=\"截图6\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/7735240a7238b15b28dba555abf0cd03f798823a.png\" alt=\"截图7\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/f643695cdd4ab9f7c95750fb8ff43f396cd16f6c.png\" alt=\"截图8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/8e152465e03a3861acf4a7be6eca82a86cf26f1a.png\" alt=\"截图9\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LMIZZNxZ/images/0126040f5bcc1828e2de2b059799ab7ffb3d08ec.png\" alt=\"截图10\"></p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>许可协议</h2>\n<p>本光影采用<strong>FlameRender (C) Studios License</strong>授权，详情请参阅<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252f127.0.0.1%253a3000%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">许可文件</a>。</p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>版本兼容性</h2>\n<p>本光影在Iris和Optifine两大着色器加载器上的兼容性不同：支持Minecraft 1.18.2+版本的Iris 1.6.10+；Optifine则因显卡厂商存在差异。建议始终使用对应Minecraft版本的最新Iris或Optifine。</p>\n<p><strong>自1.3.7版本起，将不再优先维护Optifine支持。</strong></p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Iris</th>\n<th>Windows/Linux (Intel/AMD/NVidia)</th>\n<th>Apple (M1)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.18.2+</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.17.1-</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Optifine</th>\n<th>Windows/Linux (Intel/AMD/NVidia)</th>\n<th>Apple (M1)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.17.1+</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.14.2+</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.13.2-</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>Modrinth官方页面</h2>\n<p>Super Duper Vanilla已在Modrinth上线！稳定版和最新版都会同步发布。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fsuper-duper-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>访问，欢迎通过任意下载渠道支持我们！</p>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>社交链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>加入Discord服务器参与工作室社区的其他开发讨论：<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UE85W5ynCg\" rel=\"nofollow\">FlameRender Studios Discord</a></li>\n<li>关注Twitter或订阅YouTube频道获取最新动态：<br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/eldeston\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston的Twitter</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQCkkFh25ydxZwCqpBhJJlg?view_as=subscriber\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Eldeston的频道</a></li>\n<li>您也可以通过PayPal进行赞助：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%253fhosted_button_id%253d4XLQ4WE296JKW\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal捐赠</a></li>\n</ul>",
